## Interface: 16001
## Title: ForeverData
## Notes: WoW Forever's game data for other addons: items, creatures, objects, quests and zones, what drops where and how often, where things stand, who sells and teaches what, and a search over their names. No window of its own. Data from ForeverDB.net (https://foreverdb.net), CMaNGOS classic-db, wowhead and QuestieDB.
## Author: Pietjan
## Version: 0.1

